WEBVTT

00:06:56.667 --> 00:07:00.559
with the community,
the government, this smart model,

00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:03.875
we have this big, audacious dream today.

00:07:05.042 --> 00:07:08.851
And that is to solve
a full 40 percent of the problem

00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:12.125
of out-of-school girls in India
in the next five years.

00:07:12.958 --> 00:07:19.351
(Applause)

00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:21.976
And you're thinking, that's a little ...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.018
You know, how am I even thinking
about doing that,

00:07:25.042 --> 00:07:28.875
because India is not a small place,
it's a huge country.